Onigiri kimchi-mozza
1
Onigiri filled with kimchi and mozzarella
---
rice|400|g
water|600|ml
salt|0.5|tsp
kimchi|80|g
mozzarella|20|g
sesame seeds|1|tbsp
---
Rinse the rice in cold water until the water runs clear.
Cook the rice with a 1:1.5 rice-to-water ratio over low heat without stirring.
Let rest 10 min off the heat.
Season the rice with salt and let cool slightly.
Shape into a triangle with wet hands.
Fill the centre with chopped kimchi.
Add sesame seeds.
Optional: add mozzarella in the centre.
---
bento
rice
onigiri
kimchi
cheese
---
